  │   └── skills = 2
  ├── chars = 750
  └── tokens ≈ 188 / unlimited budget (< $0.01 at $3/mil)
</stats>

"
`;

exports[`shell dispatch given: [case3] the rhx alias table when: [t1] rhx cost --repo .this --role any then: the alias renders as snapshotted — on STDOUT: stdout-rhx-cost-alias 1`] = `
"🧢 roles cost --repo .this --role any
   ├─ tokens  = 366 (full emitted payload, o200k_base)
   ├─ budget  = none declared — this boot is uncapped
   ├─ batches = 4 say · 0 ref
   ├─ chrome  = 142 tokens (38.8%) — stats blocks, xml, join seams
   │
   └─ where the tokens go
      ├─ 66  18.0%  .agent/repo=.this/role=any/skills/echo-args.sh
      ├─ 66  18.0%  .agent/repo=.this/role=any/skills/say-hello.sh
      ├─ 56  15.3%  .agent/repo=.this/role=any/briefs/sample.md
      └─ 36   9.8%  .agent/repo=.this/role=any/readme.md

   .note = the column plus chrome is the total. chrome is the renderer's own floor —
           no edit to a say or ref entry reaches it.

"
`;
